customer: retired_accountant
problem: no_sound
brief:
	The only customer who brings the same problem more than once. He is overjoyed when the sound comes back.

== drop-off
(neutral) Good day.
- Welcome to CompuFun! Lovely weather today.
	(neutral) Is it? I hadn't noticed. I've been inside with the tax returns all week.
	- So, what's your problem?
- So, what's your problem?
(problem) My computer has gone quiet. Not a sound, not even the little tune when it starts.
- Has anyone looked at it?
	(neutral) My nephew says it is something in the settings, but I don't dare touch them.
	- OK, leave it with me.
		(neutral) I need it for the tax returns, so fingers crossed it's an easy fix.
		- I'll call you as soon as I've fixed it. Have a Funtastic day!

== pick-up
(happy) Good day. Did you find out what was wrong?
- Yep, and I fixed it too!
- The sound was turned off...
(happy) It plays its little tune again? Wonderful.
- ...
- Yeah, isn't it?
(neutral) Thanks a lot.
- Good luck with those tax returns!
